    "cluster": "profitability",
    "description": "Calculate cost of goods sold from inventory, purchases and credits. Reconcile returns, costing methods, gross margin and cash with worked examples.",
    "metaDescription": "Calculate cost of goods sold from inventory, purchases and credits. Reconcile returns, costing methods, gross margin and cash with worked examples.",
